  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 source of fresh blood</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 30 spaces</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 5-space-radius</p><p>You rip blood from the body of your enemy through hundreds of tiny cuts.</p><p>Choose a blooded creature you can see within <strong>30 spaces</strong> and make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check. The creature must make an opposed <strong>Resilience check</strong>, or take <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, the area within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of the target becomes <strong>Obscured (1)</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> or <strong>1 fresh blood source</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain the blood mist. If you do so, you may move it <strong>5 spaces</strong> in any direction.</p>",
